// What one +X/+Y counter confers [CR#122.1a]: "+X/+Y" to its bearer in layer
// 7c [CR#613.4c], as the ability-free `Property` flavor. A counter
// declaration's conferral is per counter, so the deltas read no count.
(
    name: "boost",
    kinds: [Conferral],
    params: {"power": Delta, "toughness": Delta},
    body: Property(spec: PtModification(subject: This, power: Param(power), toughness: Param(toughness))),
)
